  "description": "Use when the user wants to switch this Cursor session to another Cognee dataset (saves go there, recall is restricted to it), see which datasets are available, move memory capture to a different dataset, pin recall to the active dataset (\"only recall from this dataset\"), or set recall back to auto (\"let Cognee pick the dataset again\", \"stop restricting recall\"). Switching to another dataset syncs the current session first, then starts a fresh Cognee session bound to it; \"pin\", \"auto\" and re-picking the active dataset only change the recall mode.",
